      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes please. It leads to awkward tradeoffs in the VRMC world, where blocks that would normally be 1m must be adjusted to 1.0625m to accommodate for the oversized player capsule and allow the player to fit through doors 2 blocks high. Ideally, 2 meter high doorways would not cause the player to get stuck.\n\nIf compatibility is a concern, an option in the Scene Descriptor to customize dimensions of the player capsule would allow worlds to design for a particular shape without fear that the player capsule will change in a future update.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
