  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-27T10:13:13.196Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, the player capsule is exactly 2 meters tall. \n\nThe Standard US door height in homes is 6ft 8in tall, or  2.032m.\n\nThis means that the amount of room for a player to fit through a standard height door is very small, and often enough is too small for you to fit through. You will often bump your \"head\" on the door, or get stuck. \n\nI suggest lowering the default collider height to something more reasonable, such as the average US height, or a bit higher, such as 1.7m-1.8m.",
